{
  "name": "Faded Stripe Corner Shop Frontage",
  "rationale": "Full-scale modular shop frontage with narrow weathered brick piers, two genuinely glazed display openings, and an unobstructed central doorway. Recessed lower panels, metal kickplates, projecting sills, layered door framing, a blank framed sign and a deep striped awning provide readable construction detail. The frontage faces negative Y. No wall backs the glazing, and no floor, threshold slab or diorama base is included.",
